{"fiche":"ANTICOAGULANT","contenus":[{"id":"c9da7526-9a57-494a-acc1-5b56197d2a5e","racine_id":"c9da7526-9a57-494a-acc1-5b56197d2a5e","version":1,"type":"geste","titre":"Friction hydro-alcoolique des mains","resume":"Avant et après chaque soin, après le retrait des gants.","corps":{"etapes":[{"texte":"Retirer bagues, montre et bracelets ; ongles courts, sans vernis.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Déposer une dose de solution hydro-alcoolique qui remplit le creux de la main.","vigilance":"Mains visiblement souillées : lavage au savon doux d'abord, séchage complet, puis friction."},{"texte":"Frictionner paume contre paume, puis le dos de chaque main, doigts entrecroisés.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Frictionner le dos des doigts, les pouces, puis le bout des doigts et les ongles dans la paume opposée.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Terminer par les poignets ; frictionner jusqu'à séchage complet, sans essuyer.","vigilance":"Une friction trop courte (moins de 20 à 30 secondes) laisse des zones non désinfectées."}],"materiel":["Solution hydro-alcoolique (flacon de poche)"]},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Dr Hélène Marchand","le":"2026-10-19T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Dr Hélène Marchand","qualite":"Médecin","le":"2026-10-19","revision_le":"2027-10-19"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":4,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"4c37e60e-d7c5-4296-8569-39612d110d25","racine_id":"4c37e60e-d7c5-4296-8569-39612d110d25","version":1,"type":"geste","titre":"Rotation des sites d'injection sous-cutanée","resume":"Changer de site à chaque injection et le tracer.","corps":{"etapes":[{"texte":"Vérifier l'identité du patient, la prescription, le produit, la dose et l'heure prévue.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Relire le site de la dernière injection tracé au passage précédent.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Choisir une autre zone : abdomen à distance de l'ombilic et des cicatrices, face externe des cuisses ou des bras, selon le produit.","vigilance":"Ne pas injecter dans un hématome, une zone indurée, cicatricielle ou une lipodystrophie."},{"texte":"HBPM en seringue pré-remplie : ne pas purger la bulle d'air ; pli cutané maintenu pendant toute l'injection, aiguille perpendiculaire.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Ne pas masser après l'injection ; observer le point de ponction.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Tracer le site et le côté dans le passage.","vigilance":null}],"materiel":["Seringue ou stylo prescrit","Compresses","Antiseptique selon protocole","Collecteur à aiguilles"]},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["INJECTION","ANTICOAGULANT","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE"],"tags":["injection","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Dr Hélène Marchand","le":"2026-10-18T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Dr Hélène Marchand","qualite":"Médecin","le":"2026-10-18","revision_le":"2027-10-18"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":4,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"ea635aef-e1f8-4afd-b5e8-85f7e9175e9d","racine_id":"ea635aef-e1f8-4afd-b5e8-85f7e9175e9d","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La friction hydro-alcoolique, comment ?","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:30","credit":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"IXiGWkMu27E"},"source":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-15T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-15","revision_le":"2027-10-15"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":0,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"9e131e35-0557-4602-bee0-c7ca42f595b5","racine_id":"9e131e35-0557-4602-bee0-c7ca42f595b5","version":1,"type":"question","titre":"Saignement chez un patient sous anticoagulant injectable : que faire ?","resume":null,"corps":{},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["ANTICOAGULANT"],"tags":["anticoagulants","urgence"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Paul Durand","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-20T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-20","revision_le":"2027-10-20"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":0,"utile":0,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[{"id":"8814c229-3bc1-493d-bfc5-943f0e2a84b3","texte":"Saignement minime (point d'injection, gencives, ecchymose isolée) : compression, surveillance, information du médecin dans la journée et traçabilité. Saignement abondant ou qui ne s'arrête pas, sang dans les urines, selles noires, vomissements sanglants, malaise ou maux de tête brutaux : appel du 15. Ne pas administrer la dose suivante sans avis médical en cas de saignement inexpliqué.","source":"OMEDIT Normandie, guide de poche anticoagulants 2024","auteur":{"nom":"Dr Hélène Marchand","qualite":"Médecin"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","validee":true,"validee_par":"Claire Martin, IDE","validee_le":"2026-10-20"}]},{"id":"d236e01a-ecc6-4764-a9ac-be89088fbb69","racine_id":"d236e01a-ecc6-4764-a9ac-be89088fbb69","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"Désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:05","credit":"Gustave Roussy · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"_MtZJsdr824"},"source":"Gustave Roussy","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-12T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-12","revision_le":"2027-10-12"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":0,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"d2b86bd4-ada9-4030-8364-dcab3939e408","racine_id":"d2b86bd4-ada9-4030-8364-dcab3939e408","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"2:00","credit":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"KFK7f8IMGe8"},"source":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-09T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-09","revision_le":"2027-10-09"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":0,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"9878e2b1-bb71-487e-a739-cdf1792ad9a1","racine_id":"9878e2b1-bb71-487e-a739-cdf1792ad9a1","version":1,"type":"question","titre":"Faut-il purger la bulle d'air d'une seringue pré-remplie d'HBPM ?","resume":null,"corps":{},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["ANTICOAGULANT","INJECTION"],"tags":["injection","hbpm"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Paul Durand","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-22T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-22","revision_le":"2027-10-22"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":0,"utile":3,"mon_vote":true,"reponses":[{"id":"b20460a8-14a1-4258-853b-5b97621512af","texte":"Non. La bulle d'air des seringues pré-remplies d'HBPM ne se purge pas : elle évite la perte de produit et limite l'hématome au point d'injection. Seule exception : un ajustement de dose prévu par la prescription, en suivant la notice du produit.","source":"OMEDIT Normandie, guide de poche anticoagulants 2024","auteur":{"nom":"Dr Hélène Marchand","qualite":"Médecin"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","validee":true,"validee_par":"Claire Martin, IDE","validee_le":"2026-10-22"}]},{"id":"1aa1f435-74e8-4c8f-9473-8228dccae8f8","racine_id":"1aa1f435-74e8-4c8f-9473-8228dccae8f8","version":1,"type":"question","titre":"Quelle hygiène des mains entre deux soins chez le même patient ?","resume":null,"corps":{},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Paul Durand","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-19T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-19","revision_le":"2027-10-19"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":0,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[{"id":"37d6534e-92e5-40d1-8f42-982c15bb58e3","texte":"Friction hydro-alcoolique avant et après chaque soin, y compris chez le même patient quand on passe d'un site contaminé (change, plaie) à un site propre (injection, cathéter), et après le retrait des gants. Lavage au savon doux seulement si les mains sont visiblement souillées, puis friction une fois les mains sèches.","source":"SF2H, bonnes pratiques en soins de ville, 2015","auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","validee":true,"validee_par":"Dr Hélène Marchand, Médecin","validee_le":"2026-10-19"}]},{"id":"96084b6c-d1d3-47f1-a533-4fb33a1dc912","racine_id":"96084b6c-d1d3-47f1-a533-4fb33a1dc912","version":1,"type":"document","titre":"Anticoagulants : boîte à outils","resume":null,"corps":{"url":"https://www.omedit-paysdelaloire.fr/boite-a-outils/medicaments/anticoagulants/"},"source":"OMEDIT Pays de la Loire","fiches":["ANTICOAGULANT"],"tags":["anticoagulants"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-09-27T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-09-27","revision_le":"2027-09-27"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":0,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"3d152572-73d9-4686-a555-4a694d517a5b","racine_id":"3d152572-73d9-4686-a555-4a694d517a5b","version":1,"type":"document","titre":"Bonnes pratiques essentielles en hygiène en soins de ville","resume":null,"corps":{"url":"https://www.sf2h.net/k-stock/data/uploads/2015/11/SF2H_recommandations_bonnes-pratiques-essentielles-en-hygiene-a-l-usage-des-professionnels-de-sante-en-soins-de-ville-2015.pdf"},"source":"SF2H, 2015","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URIN